<title>UK: CRICKET-BRITISH UNIVERSITIES V AUSTRALIA MATCH ABANDONED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BRITISH UNIVERSITIES V AUSTRALIA MATCH ABANDONED.</headline>
<dateline>OXFORD, England 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The three-day cricket match between British Universities and Australia was abandoned without a ball being bowled on Friday due to rain.</p>
